  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第一次乘夜航船，从绍兴府桥到西兴渡口。",
      "output_sha256": "37ec18c50039812aae02812322f6c72cd77dae93d06406f8c1c249a908417f08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "37ec18c50039812aae02812322f6c72cd77dae93d06406f8c1c249a908417f08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "绍兴到西兴本有汽油船。",
      "output_sha256": "61b6f0a8e10cdfd86582ad37500b1f4c98a639495f9d757c796850df16fb2c9a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "61b6f0a8e10cdfd86582ad37500b1f4c98a639495f9d757c796850df16fb2c9a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我因急于来杭，又因年来逐逐于火车轮船之中，也想“回到”航船里，领略先代生活的异样的趣味；所以不顾亲戚们的坚留和劝说（他们说航船里是很苦的），毅然决然的于下午六时左右下了船。",
      "output_sha256": "7c437afeea8e935c5ee84c157415fac94e04f9ec04eb6a434300c9d1c707c464",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c437afeea8e935c5ee84c157415fac94e04f9ec04eb6a434300c9d1c707c464",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有了“物质文明”的汽油船，却又有“精神文明”的航船，使我们徘徊其间，左右顾而乐之，真是二十世纪中国人的幸福了！",
      "output_sha256": "7e15e05a5bf828c7be0638fc72d8b4f06bc2f35b00e9d0cbf9d72a2266327536",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "7e15e05a5bf828c7be0638fc72d8b4f06bc2f35b00e9d0cbf9d72a2266327536",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "航船中的乘客大都是小商人；两个军弁是例外。",
      "output_sha256": "220a77ca4d5b6a88c04a67513d726662ec1e4a4a06024d00fde32d5f1dd59799",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "220a77ca4d5b6a88c04a67513d726662ec1e4a4a06024d00fde32d5f1dd59799",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "船上没有一个士大夫，尽管我或许可以算作其中的一员，因为我曾读过几年的书，并且自称是士大夫之后，但这也算是个例外！",
      "output_sha256": "8bbd3515ab06dfaccc4298dbed35d7910e473bc9455b92cdebac37cefe13cd3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.543118,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ed2ee297f2ef671658f556c2292c3af3f9607a90b4a74c9b7e4e8c3829a9afe6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8bbd3515ab06dfaccc4298dbed35d7910e473bc9455b92cdebac37cefe13cd3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "究竟那些士大夫都去哪儿了呢？",
      "output_sha256": "774c7085a100e24e1ce3c30656b4b625776389fc65d333a8b9086355f9b2e498",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.510165,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f9da1bbb3dd308402ea98e2983fedf30274b1106d4f4e4051839a1d0e6f52c46"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "774c7085a100e24e1ce3c30656b4b625776389fc65d333a8b9086355f9b2e498",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "想必他们都已转向轮船了吧！",
      "output_sha256": "15d35f0e73c00138985f67a58cb1e01434bf0cab630262fd816e62d884a36645",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.367252,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "74ac527286c4e415e569e21793056efd735edc7c4195f93c9cf7933aaa1292ee"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "15d35f0e73c00138985f67a58cb1e01434bf0cab630262fd816e62d884a36645",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "士大夫们虽然高举大旗支持精神文明，却也难免被物质文明所吸引，最终舍弃了那份旧情。",
      "output_sha256": "076cd4d06ab6ec062e1da6299a08008327044ba1b11db74d08e87b67c196e4bd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.346566,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "873b54aa09b1a8d66da75ca77cf2c0838e3774b60b7343fd4bcd9ea2e13b5275"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "076cd4d06ab6ec062e1da6299a08008327044ba1b11db74d08e87b67c196e4bd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是航船虽然照常行驶，而光彩已减少许多！",
      "output_sha256": "b7682fd32eaa99425d072bf576d22ca8b6c407d21213094d0bcd3d5f01cdbd16",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "b7682fd32eaa99425d072bf576d22ca8b6c407d21213094d0bcd3d5f01cdbd16",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这确是一件可以慨叹的事；而“国粹将亡”的呼声，似也不是徒然的了。",
      "output_sha256": "d4e3a60b100c87330b88a136ce3127bdae8a7c81131c1a906e14d2d88d508180",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4e3a60b100c87330b88a136ce3127bdae8a7c81131c1a906e14d2d88d508180",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "呜呼，是谁之咎欤？",
      "output_sha256": "0d0f94c2026005b7aa963c7c9bf3d80ec3b43cbfeb76ae9489ea7def4472a209",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d0f94c2026005b7aa963c7c9bf3d80ec3b43cbfeb76ae9489ea7def4472a209",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "既然来到这“精神文明”的航船里，正可将船里的精神文明考察一番，才不虚此一行。",
      "output_sha256": "f8a19e039d3e5624ae88cc453fffb1895df524e240474a587487c61976f1bd67",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "f8a19e039d3e5624ae88cc453fffb1895df524e240474a587487c61976f1bd67",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但从何开始呢？",
      "output_sha256": "18c1b3e24c5230204997d4e20be6a026733de0126528bd46a9f6912714c7ec89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.434121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cd5c506f8a8a25f125c51f49dba46ca46f4f3f5f13f6ea2a65aa7979b33ca1d8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "18c1b3e24c5230204997d4e20be6a026733de0126528bd46a9f6912714c7ec89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这可有些为难，踌躇之间，恰好来了一个女人。",
      "output_sha256": "3235343151374e6afaf1795ec5831725ab81f073c91bd4cde0e84df4e3304208",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "3235343151374e6afaf1795ec5831725ab81f073c91bd4cde0e84df4e3304208",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "——我说“来了”，仿佛亲眼见到，但实际上并非如此；我之所以知道她的到来，是因为听到了她尖锐的声音。",
      "output_sha256": "e14102050242db3f5e88978be9266df4089587527b058b56f3313f402f29a381",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.49926,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0c8f37998b0f397c990b3bfbb54e57c68b83880d131fbe931d64ca35b3d1c0b2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e14102050242db3f5e88978be9266df4089587527b058b56f3313f402f29a381",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至于她的面貌，我至今还没有看见呢。",
      "output_sha256": "1c266020c9ccd678c8c2b6be3f60731f305ea8151c7f9036645867ca80a97d8e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "1c266020c9ccd678c8c2b6be3f60731f305ea8151c7f9036645867ca80a97d8e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这第一要怪我的近视眼，第二要怪那袭人的暮色，第三要怪——哼——要怪那“男女分坐”的精神文明了。",
      "output_sha256": "b9fea12878597aed440238e61035ad7fe07cbd925c5ea0ba7163d4c8c0b39f19",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "b9fea12878597aed440238e61035ad7fe07cbd925c5ea0ba7163d4c8c0b39f19",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "女人坐在前面，男人坐在后面；那女人离我至少有两丈远，所以便不可见其脸了。",
      "output_sha256": "3841287e43664e89d59700156f787fae2f7e1695372f649d40716f9c2dda90a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "3841287e43664e89d59700156f787fae2f7e1695372f649d40716f9c2dda90a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "且慢，这样左怪右怪，“其词若有憾焉”，你们或者猜想那女人怎样美呢。",
      "output_sha256": "8f971c77f0a420c871b18d805a5c76da8ef364d358fee0bef08a7a5d2ac768ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "8f971c77f0a420c871b18d805a5c76da8ef364d358fee0bef08a7a5d2ac768ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而孰知又大大的不然！",
      "output_sha256": "b4af46a6fd01fc4c8291ac95957514a4c3814ce3b2d0d89754d6666a2ea1291a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4af46a6fd01fc4c8291ac95957514a4c3814ce3b2d0d89754d6666a2ea1291a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我曾“约略”看过，都是乡下的黄面婆而已。",
      "output_sha256": "f82dd70affc35f3d8a72dc07c6a16ba53962e5277a7b71d22639f6ec53c5359b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.756979,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5d52d866e7a9fe7dcd5fa29e742d531ba5be3bfe9a9993b75124228af1f6281a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f82dd70affc35f3d8a72dc07c6a16ba53962e5277a7b71d22639f6ec53c5359b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至于尖锐的语音，那是少年的妇女所常有的，倒也不足为奇。",
      "output_sha256": "481e1457d2b0ee49a8cd9d7c79d2973d0b5f1a86bb3161b5d67da89f32a9b33e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "481e1457d2b0ee49a8cd9d7c79d2973d0b5f1a86bb3161b5d67da89f32a9b33e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "然而这一次，那来了的女人的尖锐的语音竟致劳动区区的执笔者，却又另有缘故。",
      "output_sha256": "77cd8c6277afe32cf3083510a2d0ae9cf4c1bcede859b0e89d23d0154c3cacce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "77cd8c6277afe32cf3083510a2d0ae9cf4c1bcede859b0e89d23d0154c3cacce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她在那声音中，表达了对航船里精神文明的抗议；她说：“男人女人都是人！”",
      "output_sha256": "f340a75dcf787f0337444be571906c31495381bfcd49b833944d96fcff899672",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.751468,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a7fcc92fd94f10933f6cdedde05e44cf7097574d0f896869a8956d9846423770"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f340a75dcf787f0337444be571906c31495381bfcd49b833944d96fcff899672",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她想要移动到后面去（因为前面太挤，实无他意），但航船的“规矩”却不允许。",
      "output_sha256": "be82d2d70d4bd23c83e6f351d86f92225c6bfc574db3d3bf7a9da9db25642b18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.58231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4e1e15abac6c470b1690fa531d67735230f6b19f9a27fe74f7d8f9fecb488d62"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "be82d2d70d4bd23c83e6f351d86f92225c6bfc574db3d3bf7a9da9db25642b18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "船家拦住她，她以为自己不是姑娘，便鼓起勇气，慢慢说出了那句话。",
      "output_sha256": "36ebb35d5840628f48f8c55cd23f20b535e5bb78fc44544f485d5d059b1bd39b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.560322,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7362f5181040c3c5477163c179ab7de6befca44ed9b18d41ed8b2b8492000857"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "36ebb35d5840628f48f8c55cd23f20b535e5bb78fc44544f485d5d059b1bd39b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她最终还是坐回了原处，而“批评家”的议论随即纷纷而起。",
      "output_sha256": "999b245ad50f4cc03454970ab1f1832543b0a8354348e0bc641f971214c7aac4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.51343,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9ac1d55ed22eb4edf7c3b4309bcf5062b9274355667fb1054072ac70e9401fc0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "999b245ad50f4cc03454970ab1f1832543b0a8354348e0bc641f971214c7aac4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一个船家在船沿上走著，随便的说，“男人女人都是人，是的，不错。",
      "output_sha256": "457a8abcc9993ffa89b432a9463d5e78ddb7b345d44509037e72ef6119fafac7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "457a8abcc9993ffa89b432a9463d5e78ddb7b345d44509037e72ef6119fafac7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "做秤钩的也是铁，做秤锤的也是铁，做铁锚的也是铁，都是铁呀！”",
      "output_sha256": "891c27cbad5f9b49ca4411531f70025386642ce9a753465e5aca7340b8461ecf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "891c27cbad5f9b49ca4411531f70025386642ce9a753465e5aca7340b8461ecf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这一段批评大约十分巧妙，说出诸位“批评家”所要说的，于是众喙都息，这便成了定论。",
      "output_sha256": "a57518a90949cb9ad7565c63ff792cd35a6440f7d1911fef5d16c773c21af1c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "a57518a90949cb9ad7565c63ff792cd35a6440f7d1911fef5d16c773c21af1c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至于那位女士，实际上早已坐下：“孤掌难鸣”，或许她也已经厌倦了诸位“批评家”的高论，决定不再争辩。",
      "output_sha256": "f5ed268ac86ef5aef6617f9cf919c5ef7f19e6a00f6a929e5e5735bcb7705ac1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.583564,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a7991b5d769e7268c985b102bddeda6c202d9d502932d9b8f1eefa508be649d4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f5ed268ac86ef5aef6617f9cf919c5ef7f19e6a00f6a929e5e5735bcb7705ac1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是非之心”，虽然“人皆有之”，而撑船经商者流，对于名教之大防，竟能剖辨得这样“详明”，也著实亏他们了。",
      "output_sha256": "91d785248f185cb14be05e94e6325b8364829a64e767d7771feeea9d1bdef45a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "91d785248f185cb14be05e94e6325b8364829a64e767d7771feeea9d1bdef45a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "中国毕竟是礼义之邦，文明之古国呀！",
      "output_sha256": "7c0f2d42208caf3fc6150b297e4dee8d0c618f3ec55822abac73cea197634430",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c0f2d42208caf3fc6150b297e4dee8d0c618f3ec55822abac73cea197634430",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——我悔不该乱怪那“男女分坐”的精神文明了！",
      "output_sha256": "c8792c71175ac3fe638d43eff3ad2de21d3ac7ff5fdfd77cfaf157e2b4202765",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8792c71175ac3fe638d43eff3ad2de21d3ac7ff5fdfd77cfaf157e2b4202765",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“祸不单行”，凑巧又来了一个女人。",
      "output_sha256": "3e610de59ed422aed8bb9f99914f45a60f5d570d3abdcd3f870a8e1a68f339d0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e610de59ed422aed8bb9f99914f45a60f5d570d3abdcd3f870a8e1a68f339d0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她身边有男人陪伴。",
      "output_sha256": "15300df57da8c4ba189c02cd79be267b136fd9001a2e3128e5a70740fe74c61b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.416827,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "824f5c3f8b80759753cf630e166a2389aa89ccb1e886fb068c90b90e1e85f1b0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "15300df57da8c4ba189c02cd79be267b136fd9001a2e3128e5a70740fe74c61b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——呀，带著男人！",
      "output_sha256": "76b1e58d632ce653e4ca8bc9e4c621b1913504ddea4ce5a103abeca87a04c828",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "76b1e58d632ce653e4ca8bc9e4c621b1913504ddea4ce5a103abeca87a04c828",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "正因如此，才叫“祸不单行”呀！",
      "output_sha256": "86771e0e1ce74f65a61a8396a8bdfb88337b429e6356eacfff9b07b0f92c313f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.586818,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "419cc8b7889d7ea4d7ff68930dd5a32c270614673e477884613e574ab006248a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "86771e0e1ce74f65a61a8396a8bdfb88337b429e6356eacfff9b07b0f92c313f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "——她用一口流利的绍兴话说话，黑暗中隐约可见她的白脸，带着几分城市的气息。",
      "output_sha256": "a34ab978f37a399f6a81ab32f59da460a15cb7e0f543907cc10a1ec6e0921abb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.451477,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f861e863bd8a9ea395be6c8699a5b35bef4aae7a88729ea766edbe631e188297"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a34ab978f37a399f6a81ab32f59da460a15cb7e0f543907cc10a1ec6e0921abb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "船家照他们的“规矩”，要将这一对儿生刺刺的分开；男人不好意思做声，女的却抢著说，“我们是‘一堆生’①的！”",
      "output_sha256": "e586653cfc1eb92777860af48d5f8002ee84fbc9e638b624c6a35f9c0b73ebf8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "e586653cfc1eb92777860af48d5f8002ee84fbc9e638b624c6a35f9c0b73ebf8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "太亲热的字眼，竟在“规规矩矩的”航船里说了！",
      "output_sha256": "74a536cf0921ab119a984f7e9ebaab3e20ca5497a5ad504654e22af604a9a95e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "74a536cf0921ab119a984f7e9ebaab3e20ca5497a5ad504654e22af604a9a95e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是船家命令的嚷道：“我们有我们的规矩，不管你‘一堆生’不‘一堆生’的！”",
      "output_sha256": "e8e5096d2f0771fe9ef1f9ea7ce98a4d4f0f6d939d262a838282da32cfff9d75",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "e8e5096d2f0771fe9ef1f9ea7ce98a4d4f0f6d939d262a838282da32cfff9d75",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大家都微笑了。",
      "output_sha256": "12a42353edaf450c8d77d920f1da50e727c757af67ad28c3443ed6c0c20b8807",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "12a42353edaf450c8d77d920f1da50e727c757af67ad28c3443ed6c0c20b8807",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有的沉吟道：“一对儿的？”",
      "output_sha256": "8f7e3e7102a7c956c8fdbd0e256ab7a22b8cc0823f5c13fd233ad54c19545755",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.506128,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "befd725caa09d890e546e212e7b40b2334f3370215d3627aeff4571a898e08d0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8f7e3e7102a7c956c8fdbd0e256ab7a22b8cc0823f5c13fd233ad54c19545755",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有的惊讶地说：“一‘对’儿的！”",
      "output_sha256": "dd3dceea53247badbbbd15cf453c077a309a4ed396ba31865ef16a41d10cfaff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.555,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "268098219cbd586d9154e8c5ad947449981aba8b1e6750614cfffdd7bad83051"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dd3dceea53247badbbbd15cf453c077a309a4ed396ba31865ef16a41d10cfaff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有的嘲讽的说：“哼，一堆生的！”",
      "output_sha256": "fcf4b436b9a189d1b7cb0f2d0e2eb9cb612b4083b89877dd05c0711ec198d57a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "fcf4b436b9a189d1b7cb0f2d0e2eb9cb612b4083b89877dd05c0711ec198d57a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在这四面楚歌里，凭你怎样伶牙俐齿，也只得服从了！",
      "output_sha256": "b2dd1492df17f7af8e91eb81682142af4ed0566ac9cc3559a8e2d342ed1a586d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "b2dd1492df17f7af8e91eb81682142af4ed0566ac9cc3559a8e2d342ed1a586d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“妇者，服也”，这原是她的本行呀。",
      "output_sha256": "cb2211e15170f65ce310e11f203312b2e06c458e92a58619501557f1a0cb5c26",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "cb2211e15170f65ce310e11f203312b2e06c458e92a58619501557f1a0cb5c26",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只看她毫不置辩，毫不懊恼，还是若无其事的和人攀谈，便知她确乎是“服也”了。",
      "output_sha256": "bed005360a61c9b127a94fc06d1aadb82afc388b758291e67246ba12415cf7f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "bed005360a61c9b127a94fc06d1aadb82afc388b758291e67246ba12415cf7f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这不得不归功于船家和乘客们在“卫道”方面的努力，尤其是船家的表现，实在应当首屈一指。",
      "output_sha256": "fe1ee03da0ec2d94e2c2cb0f2347c37ad9b393ebddd800aa5c1a18aad0db0936",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.472124,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "76c5e63386c2c1631865a7073ee8dc441a81630a27498275d9f953a0ba964fff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fe1ee03da0ec2d94e2c2cb0f2347c37ad9b393ebddd800aa5c1a18aad0db0936",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "呜呼，可以风矣！",
      "output_sha256": "0a199ffb393e34bb0c07a61455cef4cb0d13cbe94c281a127cec4265744cbb86",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a199ffb393e34bb0c07a61455cef4cb0d13cbe94c281a127cec4265744cbb86",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "①原注：“一块儿”也。",
      "output_sha256": "69299186c840c0f67a6e14854594e62243dee3031888b97b1db0718675b105b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "69299186c840c0f67a6e14854594e62243dee3031888b97b1db0718675b105b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在黑暗里征服了两个女人，这正是我们的光荣；而航船中的精神文明，也粲然可见了——于是乎书。",
      "output_sha256": "dbd5393ef149d122ea335926dde421d412503d8edefe2b5ce6523ddf75e033b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "dbd5393ef149d122ea335926dde421d412503d8edefe2b5ce6523ddf75e033b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
